{"version":1,"content":"<p>科學家近日宣佈，一項最早提出於上世紀80年代、隨後被擱置數十年的核聚變技術取得重要突破。研究團隊首次在實際實驗中成功驗證了「螺旋波電流驅動」（Helicon Current Drive）技術，這項成果有望幫助未來的核聚變反應堆實現長時間甚至連續運行，從而推動商業化聚變發電向前邁出關鍵一步。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585960.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:20.888687+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:05:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.716216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.716216+00:00","content_hash":"0f9e7399e75a1fd0831f129014320a7f9dd989d228249c474d12a1affdc9f3a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}